+# Plan
+
+1. Change category deletion so it collects the selected category and all descendants, finds every linked product, removes only those category associations, and updates every product regardless of how many categories it has.
+2. Ensure the category entity deletion remains responsible for deleting the category subtree and descriptions, while never invoking product deletion.
+3. Resolve DELETE targets with the merchant-scoped category lookup so missing or foreign categories produce `ResourceNotFoundException`/HTTP 404 rather than deleting an unintended record.
+4. Review the resulting diff and run the relevant Maven test/build commands for the core and shop modules, including the existing category and shopping-cart tests where practical.
